    "open_questions": [
      "This is Queen's Roger Meddows Taylor (born 1949), not Duran Duran's drummer Roger Andrew Taylor (born 1960); any record of the other needs its own slug.",
      "Which kits he played on each record: the Songsterr track names (Ludwig Classic Maple, Classic Black, Fab Silver Sparkle) are the transcribers' labels, not sourced; the kit sizes here are from a secondary gear guide.",
      "Mercury 'conceived' Bohemian Rhapsody's drum parts (Wikipedia, on A Night at the Opera): how much of the ballad's part was Taylor's own is not sourced.",
      "Whether the drum loop of Another One Bites the Dust was played by Taylor and looped on tape, or edited from a longer take: Wikipedia says only that he 'added a drum loop'.",
      "Read Queen The Greatest's drum-sound episode directly; it is quoted here through Louder."
    ]
  },
